  "Tarkov.dev is not responding. Retrying in {seconds}s... attempt {attempt} of {max}.": "Tarkov.dev 无响应。{seconds} 秒后重试... 第 {attempt}/{max} 次尝试。",
  "Tarkov.dev is unavailable. Using cached data where possible. Try again in {seconds}s.": "Tarkov.dev 不可用。将尽可能使用缓存数据。请在 {seconds} 秒后重试。",
  "Tarkov.dev item data could not be loaded.": "无法加载 Tarkov.dev 物品数据。",
  "Thanks - the Circle approves.": "谢谢——Circle 表示认可。",
  "Thanks for all the feedback and support! ❤️": "感谢所有反馈和支持！❤️",
  "Thanks for sharing your find! It’s now waiting for review.": "感谢分享你的发现！现在正在等待审核。",
  "Thanks to everyone helping with fixes, testing, and recipe updates.": "感谢所有协助修复、测试和更新配方的朋友。",
  "That's already the cheapest combo from your stash.": "这已经是仓库中最便宜的组合。",
  "That's already the cheapest combo.": "这已经是最便宜的组合。",
  "The": "",
  "The API did not recover after retries. Try again when the service is stable.": "多次重试后 API 仍未恢复。请在服务稳定后重试。",
  "The API is cooling down after repeated failures. Try again in {seconds}s.": "API 多次失败后正在冷却。请在 {seconds} 秒后重试。",
  "The best you can do is {total}. Add screenshots with more valuable items, allow excluded ones, or lower the threshold.": "最高只能达到 {total}。请添加含更高价值物品的截图、允许已排除的物品或降低阈值。",
  "The calculator is showing the last cached item data.": "计算器正在显示上次缓存的物品数据。",
  "The code format is invalid. Please check and try again.": "代码格式无效，请检查后重试。",
  "The Cultist Circle uses an internal \"base value\" for items, which is different from flea or trader prices.": "Cultist Circle 对物品使用内部“基础价值”，它不同于跳蚤市场或商人价格。",
  "The demo could not be loaded. Try again in a moment.": "无法加载演示，请稍后重试。",
  "The demo screenshot is missing from this build. You can still scan your own screenshots.": "此版本缺少演示截图。你仍可扫描自己的截图。",
  "The game won't accept this item in the circle, so it can't count toward a ritual's value.": "游戏不允许将此物品放入祭坛，因此不计入仪式价值。",
  "The launcher codes no longer work.": "启动器兑换码已失效。",
  "The promo codes that gave out Ferrum dogtags have expired, so they have been removed. You need 5 Ferrum dogtags you already own.": "发放 Ferrum 狗牌的兑换码已过期，因此已被移除。你需要 5 个已拥有的 Ferrum 狗牌。",
  "The provided code doesn't contain any items.": "提供的代码中没有任何物品。",
  "The ritual remains in history as cancelled and will not affect insights.": "该仪式将以已取消的状态保留在历史记录中，不会影响统计。",
  "The sacrifices listed below can be repeated indefinitely.": "以下献祭可无限次重复。",
  "The scan failed. Try again.": "扫描失败，请重试。",
  "The screenshot could not be read.": "无法读取截图。",
  "The screenshot is too large to upload.": "截图过大，无法上传。",
  "The selected items cannot be arranged in the Cultist Circle box (9x6).": "所选物品无法放入 Cultist Circle 盒子（9x6）。",
  "The Weapon category is disabled by default for two main reasons:": "武器类别默认禁用，主要有两个原因：",
  "These cookies are essential for the website to function properly. They enable basic functions like page navigation, access to secure areas, and proper website operation. The website cannot function properly without these cookies.": "这些 Cookie 是网站正常运行所必需的。它们支持页面导航、访问安全区域和网站正常运作等基本功能。没有这些 Cookie，网站将无法正常运行。",
  "These cookies are necessary for the website to function properly and cannot be switched off.": "这些 Cookie 是网站正常运行所必需的，无法关闭。",
  "These cookies are used to deliver advertisements more relevant to you and your interests. They are also used to limit the number of times you see an advertisement and help measure the effectiveness of advertising campaigns.": "这些 Cookie 用于投放更符合你和你兴趣的广告。它们还用于限制同一广告的展示次数，并帮助衡量广告活动的效果。",
  "These cookies are used to make advertising messages more relevant to you and your interests.": "这些 Cookie 用于让广告内容更符合你和你的兴趣。",
  "These cookies help us improve the site by tracking which pages are most popular and how visitors move around the site.": "这些 Cookie 通过统计最受欢迎的页面和访客的浏览路径来帮助我们改进网站。",
  "These items are completely incompatible with ritual mechanics.": "这些物品与仪式机制完全不兼容。",
  "These items can still be received as rewards from 14h rituals, but never from the 6h \"Quest/Hideout\" ritual.": "这些物品仍可从14小时仪式中获得，但永远不会从6小时\"任务/藏身处\"仪式中获得。",
  "These items cannot reach {threshold} with {slots} slots.": "这些物品在 {slots} 个槽位内无法达到 {threshold}。",
  "They will be consumed with no reward:": "它们将被消耗且没有奖励：",
  "This application is actively maintained and updated regularly.": "此应用正在积极维护并定期更新。",
  "This clears calculator settings, exclusions, and preferred price modes. Ritual history is preserved.": "这将清除计算器设置、排除项和首选价格模式。仪式记录会保留。",
  "This plan uses matches that have not been checked yet": "此计划使用了尚未检查的匹配",
  "This recipe can only be reported for PVP Season.": "此配方只能针对 PVP 赛季进行报告。",
  "This recipe can only be reported for PVP.": "此配方只能针对 PVP 进行报告。",
