  "Use suggested k (midpoint)": "使用建议的 k（中点）",
  "Use the main table's search box to find your weapon and read its base price. Enter totals below.": "使用主表格的搜索框找到你的武器并查看其基础价格，然后在下方输入总额。",
  "Use the original timer, before it counted down. Regular sacrifice timers aren’t recipes.": "请使用倒计时开始前的原始计时器。普通献祭计时器不算配方。",
