  "View": "查看",
  "View {name} on Tarkov.dev": "在 Tarkov.dev 上查看 {name}",
  "View community report details": "查看社区报告详情",
  "View on Tarkov.dev": "在 Tarkov.dev 查看",
  "View the special recipe →": "查看特殊配方 →",
  "Visual Placement Preview": "摆放可视化预览",
  "We store your calculator preferences locally, including excluded item categories, threshold settings, sort options, and custom price overrides. If you use the Ritual Tracker, its countdowns, sacrifices, returned rewards, notes, and price snapshots are stored in IndexedDB in this browser. This data stays on your device and is not uploaded to Cultist Circle.": "我们在本地存储你的计算器偏好设置，包括排除的物品类别、阈值设置、排序选项和自定义价格覆盖。如果你使用 Ritual Tracker，其倒计时、献祭、返还奖励、备注和价格快照都存储在此浏览器的 IndexedDB 中。这些数据保留在你的设备上，不会上传到 Cultist Circle。",
  "We use cookies to enhance your experience.": "我们使用 Cookies 来提升你的体验。",
  "We use different types of cookies to optimize your experience on our website. Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device when you visit our website.": "我们使用不同类型的 Cookies 来优化体验。Cookies 是你访问网站时存储在设备上的小型文本文件。",
  "We use Google Analytics and PostHog to understand how players use our calculator. This helps us improve features like item filtering, price thresholds, and category management. Analytics only run when you allow them through the cookie preferences panel.": "我们使用 Google Analytics 和 PostHog 来了解玩家如何使用我们的计算器。这有助于我们改进物品筛选、价格阈值和类别管理等功能。分析仅在你通过 Cookie 偏好设置面板允许时才会运行。",
  "Weapon Base Values - Work in Progress:": "武器基础价值 - 开发中：",
  "Weapon base values are complex and can vary based on durability and the specific combination of attached parts/mods.": "武器的基础价值较复杂，会因耐久度和所装配件/改装件的组合而变化。",
  "Weapon base values are tied to their trader sell prices. Rare or high-tier weapons like the": "武器的基础价值与其商人收购价挂钩。稀有或高级武器，例如",
  "Weapon base values may be inaccurate. In addition to durability and attachments, weapons appear to use a special (currently unknown) multiplier that we have not fully worked out yet.": "武器基础价值可能不准确。除耐久和配件外，武器似乎使用了特殊（尚未知）的倍数，我们尚未完全确定。",
  "Weighted average over the last 24h": "过去 24 小时的加权平均值",
  "Welcome to Cultist Circle": "欢迎来到 Cultist Circle",
  "What are 'Hot Sacrifices'?": "什么是'热门献祭'？",
  "What are 'Item Hints'?": "什么是'物品提示'？",
