  "Why are some items hidden in 'Excluded Categories'?": "为什么某些物品在'排除类别'中被隐藏？",
  "Why are weapons hidden by default?": "为什么武器默认隐藏？",
  "Why can't I use certain items in the ritual?": "为什么我不能在仪式中使用某些物品？",
  "Why do some weapons have such high Base Values?": "为什么某些武器的基础价值这么高？",
  "WIP": "进行中",
