  "Yes, Delete Everything": "是，全部删除",
  "yesterday": "昨天",
  "You can check the {list} list for known, community-tested combos.": "可在 {list} 列表中查看社区验证过的已知组合。",
  "You can enable weapons in": "你可以在以下位置启用武器：",
  "You can still click any cell on the screenshot to change it.": "你仍可点击截图中的任意格子进行更改。",
  "You can still sacrifice it, and it can come from 14h rituals, but the 6h ritual never returns it.": "你仍可献祭它，它也可能来自 14 小时仪式，但 6 小时仪式从不产出它。",
  "You have met the threshold. A cooldown has been triggered.": "你已达到阈值，已触发冷却。",
  "You haven't added any items to your favorites yet. Click the star icon next to an item to add it to your favorites.": "你还没有收藏任何物品。点击物品旁的星标即可加入收藏。",
  "You will only receive the recipe reward, not the normal threshold reward.": "你只会获得配方奖励，而不是常规的阈值奖励。",
  "You'll find them in the": "你可以在主计算器页面的",
  "Your browser may block clipboard images. Try again.": "浏览器可能阻止了剪贴板图片，请重试。",
  "Your calculator settings and exclusions will be reset. Ritual history will remain available in the Tracker.": "计算器设置和排除项将被重置。仪式记录仍可在追踪器中查看。",
