  "Your stash and this plan will open in the calculator.": "你的仓库和此计划将在计算器中打开。",
  "Your stash can't reach the remaining ₽{remaining} with {slots} slots. Unpin an item, rescan, or add more screenshots.": "仓库物品用 {slots} 个槽位无法达到剩余的 ₽{remaining}。请取消固定一个物品、重新扫描或添加更多截图。",
  "Your stash can't reach the threshold with the current slots. Untick kept items or rescan.": "以当前槽位数，你的仓库无法达到阈值。请取消勾选保留的物品或重新扫描。",
